						730760205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760205,
					"content": "对，最近一段时间我都住在这里…哈哈我懂了，看到一个枫丹人住在须弥野外的帐篷，觉得很不可思议对吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760206,
					"content": "至于为什么这样，就让我好好解释一番吧…啊，首先，两位的名字是？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760207,
					"content": "我叫派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760208,
					"content": "#我叫{NICKNAME}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760209
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730760209,
					"content": "#原来如此，是{NICKNAME}和派蒙，我记住了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760210,
					"content": "我是桑顿，如你们所见，我是一个枫丹人…之所以来须弥的理由嘛，当然是因为喜欢森林！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760211,
					"content": "总是生活在城市中，身体会因为缺少锻炼而衰弱，精神也会变得松懈和倦怠。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760212,
					"content": "只有在广袤的自然中，才能重新得到那种与自然万物共存的深刻体会，而森林正是贴近自然最好的选择。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760213,
					"content": "所以就来须弥了，毕竟这里的森林大概是全提瓦特最好的森林啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760214,
					"content": "好像听懂了，但是又好像完全没有懂…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760215,
					"content": "不过须弥的森林可是很危险的，有各种大大小小的魔物…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760216,
					"content": "当然要危险才行啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760217,
					"content": "啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760218,
					"content": "要是不危险的话，就没有那种求生的感觉了！不用担心，我其实在枫丹也是有名的猎人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760219,
					"content": "什么呀，原来你说喜欢森林，是喜欢在森林里狩猎！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760220,
					"content": "哼，根本就是个枫丹来的偷猎者！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760221,
						730760222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760221,
					"content": "偷猎会破坏生态…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760223
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730760223,
					"content": "等等等等，你们弄错了，我可不是偷猎者…偷猎可是相当严重的违法行为。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760224,
					"content": "在枫丹如果被抓到偷猎，那一辈子就完了，我可不敢。我们枫丹猎人所做的，其实大多只是「凶猛动物的防治」而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760225,
					"content": "凶猛动物的…防治？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760226,
					"content": "你想啊，太过靠近人类居住区的凶猛动物会导致双方都受到伤害吧…所以得把它们赶到居住区一定距离以外才行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760227,
					"content": "是、是这样啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760228,
					"content": "这样，附近的居民就不用面临凶猛动物的侵扰，而对于那些动物来说，居民的活动也不会对它们正常生活产生困扰。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760229,
					"content": "实不相瞒，我也是听说了附近有类似的凶猛动物，接受了驱逐它们的委托，才住在这里的，身为猎人，怎么能坐视不管呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760230,
					"content": "…当然了，我个人也对这些凶猛动物有点兴趣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760231,
					"content": "你看，这个就很让人在意，「生长过度的大型鳄鱼」，被孩子们称为「鳄鱼大王」，总觉得是在什么下水道传说里出现的角色。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760232,
					"content": "#啊，大型鳄鱼，{NICKNAME}，会不会说的就是我们遇到过的那条…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760233,
					"content": "什么，传说中的「鳄鱼大王」已经被你们驱逐掉了吗！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760234,
					"content": "据说「鳄鱼大王」在奔流之间浮出水面，就如突然升起、将河水阻断的巨大沙洲，怎么样，真的有那么夸张吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760235,
						730760237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760235,
					"content": "正是如此！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760236
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730760236,
					"content": "真是了不起啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760240,
					"content": "从刚才就觉得，你们身上有那种，就是那种，老练猎人一般的气息，看来我并没有看走眼！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760241
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760241,
					"content": "那是当然啦，我们也经历过很多了不起的事呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760242,
					"content": "除了「鳄鱼大王」，还有其他两只凶猛动物，「抓走孩童的长鬓虎罗阇」，「拦在通往璃月山路上的巨大驮兽」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760243,
					"content": "「长鬓虎罗阇」好像在西边的密林里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760244,
					"content": "「驮兽大王」据说是只巨大无比的驮兽。几个看到它后吓破胆子的目击者说，它在东边的某块区域徘徊，一见到行人就会攻击。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760245
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760245,
					"content": "听上去都挺危险的呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760246
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760246,
					"content": "是啊，要是你们遇到了，一定要小心…哈哈，不过对于能够解决「鳄鱼大王」的你们来说，我的担忧恐怕是多余的啦，哈哈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760247
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760247,
					"content": "如果路上遇到了，就帮忙驱逐一下这些凶猛动物吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760248
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760248,
					"content": "这样周围的居民也不会遇到危险了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760249
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760249,
					"content": "嗯，如果遇到的话…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760250
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730760250,
					"content": "那真是太感谢了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760251
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760251,
					"content": "附近居民的安全，这些凶猛动物的安全，当然了，还有你们自己的安全，都要注意啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760252
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760252,
					"content": "嗯嗯，知道啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760237,
					"content": "传闻多少有点夸张…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760238
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730760238,
					"content": "是、是嘛…不知为何感觉有点失望。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760239,
					"content": "不过普通体型的鳄鱼已经很难对付了，应付生长时间更长更狡猾的「鳄鱼大王」想必更加凶险。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 730760222,
					"content": "那我们必须干预一下了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730760223
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7307603,
			"completionStepIds": [],
